      <div class="container">
        <div class="approach__intro">
          <h2 id="approach-title" class="statement">Three steps. No shortcuts.</h2>
          <p class="approach__lead">Every supply and system we take on follows the same considered process, because every source needs to be understood before it can be treated.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="approach__grid">
          <article class="step">
            <div class="numeral step__num" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
            <h3>Understand your source</h3>
            <p>We start with a site survey and a UKAS-accredited water analysis. Nothing gets specified before we know exactly what we are dealing with.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step">
            <div class="numeral step__num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
            <h3>Design the system</h3>
            <p>We design the filtration, storage and treatment to match your source and your property's demand. Everything specified is chosen for reliability and long service life.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step">
            <div class="numeral step__num" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
            <h3>Install and maintain</h3>
            <p>Our own engineers install every system. Once you're up and running, we service it on a schedule, and answer emergency calls the same day.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

